(4) Such lot is not used beyond its capacity; and
(5) Proper record is made of the name and age of the deceased person, the date of death, date of burial, and the exact location of the grave. Such information shall be provided to the clerk's office.
(Code 2005, § 4-3-4; Ord. of 12-10-2012)

